# Fury (evoked, exiling a Lightning Bolt) divides 4 damage as 1 to one Ornithopter and 3 to the other; in response Bot2 Bolts the
# second one, its own, away. The trigger resolves for the target that is left (CR 608.2b): that Ornithopter has exactly 1 damage
# marked - its own share, not the missing creature's - and Fury is then sacrificed by the evoke trigger.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fury
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mountain x10

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fury.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Divide(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1: 1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2: 3)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1
? Bot1.Graveyard = Fury

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1
